{
  "dsl": "octos.lesson",
  "version": "0.1",
  "profile": "authoring",
  "lesson": {
    "mode": "explain",
    "language": "zh-CN",
    "title": "竖直线与水平线的斜率辨析：为什么 x=2 没有斜率？",
    "goals": [
      "通过两个变化量的比值澄清斜率定义，理解分母 Δx 为 0 导致竖直线斜率不存在",
      "对比水平线（斜率为 0）与竖直线（无斜率），纠正二者的混淆"
    ],
    "adaptation": {
      "strategies": [
        "逐步比较变化量：拆解 Δx 与 Δy，精准定位为什么分母为 0 导致算式未定义",
        "用简明对比板书锁定水平线与竖直线的根本差异"
      ]
    },
    "variables": [
      {
        "as": "number_01",
        "initial": 0,
        "min": -5,
        "max": 5,
        "label": "斜率 k",
        "control": {
          "kind": "slider",
          "step": 0.05
        }
      }
    ],
    "tasks": [
      {
        "as": "section-02-task-01",
        "prompt": "请把斜率 k调到 -5。",
        "availability": {
          "kind": "after_lesson"
        },
        "hints": [
          "拖动左下角的滑杆，观察数值和画面同步变化。"
        ],
        "hint_after_attempts": 2,
        "success_message": "完成，斜率 k已经调到 -5。",
        "allowed_operations": [
          {
            "kind": "variable_change",
            "variable": "number_01",
            "controls": [
              "slider"
            ]
          }
        ],
        "completion": {
          "kind": "expression_target",
          "expression": "number_01",
          "value": -5,
          "tolerance": 0.025
        },
        "start": {
          "kind": "practice",
          "variables": [
            "number_01"
          ]
        }
      }
    ]
  },
  "steps": [
    {
      "key": "section-01",
      "purpose": "从斜率的定义式出发，代入 x=2 上的两点，分析为什么竖直线斜率未定义而非 0",
      "beats": [
        {
          "key": "moment-01",
          "say": "这是一个值得收藏的问题。你敏锐地指出了核心矛盾：竖直直线的斜率确实不是 0。我们直接来看直线 x=2 的具体变化量。",
          "delivery": "encouraging",
          "actions": [
            {
              "do": "write",
              "as": "opening-title",
              "kind": "note",
              "role": "explanation",
              "content": {
                "title": "竖直线与水平线的斜率辨析：为什么 x=2 没有斜率？",
                "items": [
                  "本课导入"
                ]
              },
              "place": {
                "relation": "new_region"
              },
              "when": "before_speech"
            },
            {
              "do": "write",
              "as": "section-01-moment-01-item-01",
              "kind": "note",
              "role": "explanation",
              "content": {
                "title": "直线的斜率定义",
                "items": [
                  "斜率度量纵向变化与横向变化的比值",
                  "k = Δy / Δx"
                ]
              },
              "place": {
                "relation": "new_region",
                "region_role": "section-01"
              },
              "when": "after_speech"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "key": "moment-02",
          "say": "斜率的本质是两个变化量的比值：横坐标增加多少，纵坐标相应增加多少。在平面直角坐标系中，两点确定一条直线。",
          "delivery": "careful",
          "actions": [
            {
              "do": "write",
              "as": "section-01-moment-02-item-01",
              "kind": "plot",
              "role": "main_visual",
              "content": {
                "title": "函数图像",
                "axes": {
                  "x": {
                    "min": -4,
                    "max": 4,
                    "label": "x"
                  },
                  "y": {
                    "min": -1,
                    "max": 1,
                    "label": "y"
                  }
                },
                "curves": [
                  {
                    "as": "primary-curve",
                    "expression": "(number_01)*(x)",
                    "label": "y = kx"
                  }
                ],
                "points": [
                  {
                    "as": "reference-a",
                    "x": 0,
                    "y": 0,
                    "label": "A"
                  },
                  {
                    "as": "reference-b",
                    "x": 1,
                    "y": 0,
                    "label": "B"
                  }
                ],
                "bindings": [
                  {
                    "target": "reference-a.y",
                    "expression": "(number_01)*(0)"
                  },
                  {
                    "target": "reference-b.y",
                    "expression": "(number_01)*(1)"
                  }
                ],
                "measurement": "secant",
                "sample_input": "fixed_x"
              },
              "place": {
                "relation": "new_region",
                "region_role": "section-01"
              }
            },
            {
              "do": "write",
              "as": "section-01-moment-02-item-02",
              "kind": "math",
              "role": "derivation",
              "content": {
                "latex": "k = \\frac{\\Delta y}{\\Delta x} = \\frac{y_2 - y_1}{x_2 - x_1}"
              },
              "place": {
                "relation": "below",
                "anchor": "section-01-moment-02-item-01"
              },
              "when": "during_speech"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "key": "moment-03",
          "say": "现在我们核对直线 x=2。在这条线上任取两个不同的点，比如 (2, 1) 和 (2, 4)。纵坐标的变化量 Δy 是 4 减 1 等于 3。",
          "delivery": "neutral",
          "actions": [
            {
              "do": "point",
              "target": "section-01-moment-02-item-01",
              "when": "during_speech"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "key": "moment-04",
          "say": "关键就在横坐标：两点的横坐标都是 2，横坐标的变化量 Δx 等于 2 减 2，也就是 0。算式变成了 3 除以 0。",
          "delivery": "careful",
          "actions": [
            {
              "do": "write",
              "as": "section-01-moment-04-item-01",
              "kind": "math",
              "role": "derivation",
              "content": {
                "latex": "k = \\frac{4 - 1}{2 - 2} = \\frac{3}{0}"
              },
              "place": {
                "relation": "below",
                "anchor": "section-01-moment-02-item-02"
              },
              "when": "after_speech"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "key": "moment-05",
          "say": "在算术中，除数不能为 0，这个比值根本没有定义。所以，直线 x=2 的斜率不是 0，而是不存在。",
          "delivery": "emphatic",
          "actions": [
            {
              "do": "focus",
              "targets": [
                "section-01-moment-02-item-01"
              ],
              "intent": "锁定分母为0导致未定义的算式",
              "when": "before_speech"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "key": "section-02",
      "purpose": "通过水平线 y=c 与竖直线 x=c 的对比，明确斜率为 0 与斜率不存在的区别",
      "beats": [
        {
          "key": "moment-01",
          "say": "我们已经清楚，竖直线 x=2 上的分母 Δx 是 0，因此斜率未定义。那么，真正的斜率为 0 究竟对应什么直线？",
          "delivery": "patient",
          "actions": [
            {
              "do": "focus",
              "targets": [
                "section-01-moment-02-item-01"
              ],
              "intent": "继续观察当前画面",
              "when": "after_speech"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "key": "moment-02",
          "say": "先逐步比较变化量：如果直线水平，当横坐标从 0 增加到 2，Δx 是 2；而纵坐标完全没有升降，Δy 是 0。两者的比值 0 除以 2，结果才恰好是 0。",
          "delivery": "careful",
          "actions": [
            {
              "do": "write",
              "as": "section-02-moment-02-item-01",
              "kind": "math",
              "role": "derivation",
              "content": {
                "latex": "k = \\frac{\\Delta y}{\\Delta x} = \\frac{0}{\\Delta x} = 0\\quad (\\Delta x \\neq 0)"
              },
              "place": {
                "relation": "below",
                "anchor": "section-01-moment-02-item-01"
              },
              "when": "during_speech"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "key": "moment-03",
          "say": "现在把这两类特殊直线放在一起对照：水平线 y=c 的分子为 0，分母非 0，斜率等于 0；而竖直线 x=c 的分母直接为 0，斜率根本不存在。",
          "delivery": "emphatic",
          "actions": [
            {
              "do": "write",
              "as": "section-02-moment-03-item-01",
              "kind": "note",
              "role": "explanation",
              "content": {
                "title": "水平线与竖直线的斜率辨析",
                "items": [
                  "水平线 (y = c)：Δy = 0 且 Δx ≠ 0，斜率 k = 0",
                  "竖直线 (x = c)：Δx = 0，分母为 0 无意义，斜率不存在（未定义）"
                ]
              },
              "place": {
                "relation": "below",
                "anchor": "section-02-moment-02-item-01"
              },
              "when": "after_speech"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "key": "moment-04",
          "say": "课后可以亲自尝试把斜率 k 调回 0，直观观察水平线在坐标系中的平缓形态。",
          "delivery": "encouraging",
          "actions": [
            {
              "do": "focus",
              "targets": [
                "section-02-moment-03-item-01"
              ],
              "intent": "继续观察当前画面",
              "when": "after_speech"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "close": {
    "summary": "水平线分子 Δy 为 0，斜率是 0；竖直线分母 Δx 为 0，除法没有意义，所以直线 x=2 的斜率不存在。",
    "focus": [
      "section-01-moment-02-item-01"
    ]
  }
}
